;    9: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=てきがいしん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だいたいぶ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=つ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=61, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=わな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=こわいろ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=36, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=とが, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   19: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=もも, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   20: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おび, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   21: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=8364, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=7428, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―By feel, it's around 11 p.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
April 8 is almost over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mom's</STYLE> third-year memorial service is over, and ordinary days are about to start again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether those ordinary days will be ordinary for me, I don't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I do nothing, they'll probably turn into days that aren't ordinary at all.<PG>
Going by the information and guesses from <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜散る.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
By tomorrow morning, the Arata settlement will perish.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And as many Arata cherries will be born as there are residents.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The prophecy that today, something from outside would destroy the Arata settlement...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was that <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san's</STYLE> prophecy, or did Verde have some means of sending out information? I can't be sure.<PG>
But if the Arata cherry is looking for hosts and killing the residents, like <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> guessed, then what it means for the Arata settlement to perish should change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If everyone's minds have been taken over by the Arata cherry, then they're the Arata cherry's mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, it's not
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'the Arata settlement perishes = the residents perish'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
but rather
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'the Arata settlement perishes = the Arata cherry perishes'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―is that what it comes down to...?<PG>
Thinking about it that way, it seems to add up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If none of us had come, not me, not <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, not <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, and not the White Hannya either, the Arata cherry would probably have reproduced successfully without a hitch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why the Arata cherry itself knows there's a chance we'll destroy it and save everyone.<PG>
Even so, is it really possible for cherry trees to parasitize humans and reproduce...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've heard stories about parasites that take over insects' brains, or that breed inside human bodies, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But like <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> said, what's happening now defies common sense, so we need ideas that defy common sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I get that, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I've been going around in circles on thoughts like these for about 15 minutes now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've been watching the meeting hall, but there's no movement at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lights are on, so there must be people inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's a good chance nothing will move until morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I go in after all...?<PG>
A little closer. Just a little closer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least close enough to hear the sounds inside―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田集集会所夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Holding my breath, I feel for any presence inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
They're here... 
{PAUSE ""}
A lot of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From inside I can only faintly hear some <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="せきばら">throat-clearing</STYLE>, but there are definitely a lot of people in there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there no lookout?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Never mind me, but if that White Hannya came again, it'd be a disaster for the residents, I'd think...<PG>
No... wait a second.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They should be at least that cautious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they aren't, could it be... it's already too late...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If everyone's already been completely taken over by the Arata cherry, then there's no saving them, is there...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly, someone's presence behind me...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I draw my knife fast and spin around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE>!? <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE>!?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\般若全身大.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田集集会所夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\般若全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Wha...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The White Hannya...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The white hannya Noh mask is a mask that depicts a woman's vengeful spirit, said to be <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="てきがいしん">hostility</STYLE>―grudges and revenge―turned into art.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And, wrapped in white robes, it carries a well-worn nata and a mace.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Wh-what are you...! So you're an enemy after all...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\白般若鉈振り上げ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And the White Hannya raises its nata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew it. Right here, it's going to... me...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "5" "200" "540" "1" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\剣衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\白般若鉈振り下ろし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Without hesitation, it brings the blade down right where I was standing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I dodge it by a hair, but the White Hannya's blatant show of hostility puts me on edge.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "20" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\春花こける.lcm" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The White Hannya recovers its stance faster than I do, and the next thing I know it's hooked the head of its mace around my leg, and like a kid running on ice, I do a quarter turn in the air and land on my backside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鉈を構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\春花鉈当てられる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Instantly, the nata is pressed to my throat.<PG>
Dammit...! This is as far as I get...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The nata is badly chipped. Forget lopping my head off, it probably couldn't even sever an artery.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the gap in strength is more than enough to kill my will to fight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's it going to do...?
{PAUSE ""}
　What's it going to do...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\白般若鉈振り下ろしハンマー上げ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And now it raises the mace high for a full swing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My opponent is half-crouched, with both hands full of weapons.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is my chance...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "20" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I got my knife thrown before the White Hannya could bring the mace down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The knife hits the White Hannya's mask, but it doesn't stick and just drops to the ground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, it seems to have made the White Hannya flinch a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that opening, I get up and put plenty of distance between us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田集集会所夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\般若全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Dammit! This thing is obviously holding back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When it fought <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE>, it was nothing like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is every last one of them making a fool of me...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though thanks to that, I'm still unhurt...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What do I do? The knife's at its feet and I'm unarmed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is running my only option...?<PG>
Besides, even if I turn my back and run, if it chases me there's nothing I can do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I've got no choice but to show I don't want to fight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I go down now, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> will be left on their own.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"W-wait! I don't want to fight you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n0\r\n2000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
Making it clear I have no intention of fighting, I slowly back away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-400\r\n2000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-400\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
