{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> totters to her feet and starts walking toward me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She reaches out as if to hug me and staggers my way, but I back away a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> keeps coming straight at me, and at last she wraps her arms around me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死ぬ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... I'm sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I... I've been scared all this time... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Everyone went weird a long time ago... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... got killed too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Clinging to me with all her strength, <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> pours out what's in her heart, then sinks to the ground again as if her knees have given out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> won't let go of me.<PG>
I crouch down too and look <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> in the eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Come on, talk. What were you scared of?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Everyone went weird, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you're the only one who didn't?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> nods silently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And starts sniffling and crying again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Since everyone went weird, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you went along with them?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―And again, <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> nods.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"The only one who didn't go weird... it was just you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> nods.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> are both too far gone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> nods.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Why were you the only one, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, who didn't go weird?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> shakes her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Do you know how this happened?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> shakes her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"You don't know anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> nods.<PG>
And just then―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The meeting hall door opens.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the residents come trooping out from inside, barefoot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ready my knife at once.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\背景\女神\死神行列.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Everyone... where are you going...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Hey..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still sitting on the ground, <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> lets out a cry that can't even become a cry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">The residents don't even look our way, and walk off toward who knows where.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And last of all, <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Kotaro-san</STYLE> come out from inside.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\背景\女神\幸太郎茅萱行列.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! Where are you going!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At her tearful cry, <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Kotaro-san</STYLE> show no reaction at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With no expression at all, the two of them head off somewhere, backs bent and arms hanging.<PG>
Have their minds already been completely taken over by the Arata cherry?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> said, does it control the hosts' bodies, move them to the best spot to sprout, and have them give out there?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is everyone already no different from a corpse?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does that mean I didn't make it in time...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> gets up and runs weakly over to <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, come on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even when she tugs at <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> arm and shakes it, <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> just walks on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just walking, like a robot programmed only to walk.<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Ow...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
