{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But he didn't step on it on purpose. <STYLE ID="7">Kana's</STYLE> foot just happened to be there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
