{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> shows no interest at all in the two of them and keeps walking.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, come on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
