<STYLE ID="7">　Hey, why won't anybody answer me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course. <STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE> theory is only a guess, but <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> still doesn't know how the Arata cherry lives.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I be the one to tell her that everyone will be parasitized by a cherry tree and die?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This one's still only 12, right...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then―<PG>
