<STYLE ID="7">I'd heard something like that before. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Everyone's past saving now, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Then at least I want to be with </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> at the end..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"It's okay. This happened because I kept quiet for a whole year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So... I'll at least do that much. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... let me be with them at the end, at least..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> weakly turns her steps toward the Niimura house.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... for pulling a knife on you and hitting you earlier..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> starts walking without turning to face me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same moment, the White Hannya puts its knife away too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神全身丸腰.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> isn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="だま">tricking</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> us, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Is </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> really sane?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The White Hannya doesn't answer, and shows no sign of denying it either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So its silence means yes?<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Then that's fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">When morning comes, I'm getting out of here with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and Goto. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">And I'll take </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> in, and we'll live together in Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">So don't get in my way anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I leave the meeting hall behind and decide to head back to <STYLE ID="7">Kana's</STYLE> secret base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm worried about <STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE> too, but for now I'll let her do as she wants.<PG>
The White Hannya doesn't come after me. It just watches me go from where it stands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do now is head to <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way left to save everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was all too late.
